          "docs": "This API endpoint allows the creation of a bearer token. The API endpoint can also be used to create a new room, once a room is created, participants can join it, creating a conference. Once a room is created, the validity period is 15 minutes.  More example on this API usages can be found [here](/connect/docs/token-example-creation).\n### Authentication:\n- 8x8 Video Interaction API utilizes an 8x8 API Key for authentication.\n\t- You can create a API key directly from the Connect Portal. The proce"
